  "scope": "Exact paged bf16 top-k 4 qload4 route (plan test test_topk4_qload4_plan_has_exact_geometry_and_segments and benchmark row official_prefill_bf16_b3_q4096_kv8192_h8_hkv2_k4_paged, seed 73, sm_count 148): batch 3, seqlen_q 4096, seqlen_kv 8192, H 8, H_kv 2, topk 4, causal with derived q offset, 192 pages of [2, 128, 128]; grid 389 over the 389 active scheduler records (M1), k2q_row_ptr [2, 193], cu_seqlens_q, cu_seqlens_k, q_offsets and kv_lens fixed by shape arrays; k2q_qsplit_indices (payload q_idx | slot << 24) bounded to [0, 50335743] and page_table to [0, 191] by tensor_properties (contents not fixed). Compared outputs: partial_o e4m3 [4, 12288, 8, 128], partial_scale f32 [4, 12288, 8], partial_lse f32 [4, 12288, 8]; partial_temperature_lse is not written (return_temperature_lse 0). Coverage: the planner requires four live slots per query row and kv head (build_bf16_paged_topk4_plan), so every partial row is written once; the input states only bounds for the payloads.",
  "semantics": "ideal_real; split s of (q_abs, head g) is attention over the s-th selected KV block alone: O = exp2(softmax_scale_log2 q.k)-weighted mean of v over the block's visible tokens, partial_lse = ln(sum of the weights) (-inf if none), partial_scale = max|O|/448, partial_o = e4m3(O * 448 / max|O|); the block of (s, q_abs, h) is the CSR row of the head-h edge whose payload decodes to (s, q_abs)",
